Package: lumo-settings
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Lumo OS Team <salom600@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, lumo-theme, network-manager,
 pulseaudio-utils, brightnessctl
Description: Lumo OS settings application
 Real settings application for Lumo OS with 18 modules: Wi-Fi, Bluetooth,
 Network, Background, Appearance (dark/light + accent), Notifications,
 Sound, Power, Displays, Mouse & Touchpad, Keyboard, Printers, Region &
 Language (Arabic/RTL ready), Accessibility, Users, Date & Time, Default
 Applications and About. Each module drives the actual system backend
 (nmcli, bluetoothctl, pactl, wlr-randr, localectl, timedatectl,
 AccountsService, labwc libinput configuration).
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/salom600/lumo-os
